# Checkout.com: High-performance global payments platform for enterprise and scaling businesses

Checkout.com is a financial technology company that provides a cloud-based payments platform enabling businesses to accept payments, send payouts, manage card programs, and optimize payment performance across six continents.

## Products

### Connect — Global Payments Network

- [Accept Online](https://www.checkout.com/products/accept-online): Process payments with flexible integration options tailored to your business.
- [Unified Payments API](https://www.checkout.com/products/unified-payments-api): Connect to all payment methods through a single API integration.
- [Flow](https://www.checkout.com/products/flow): Boost conversions with customizable payment blocks and checkout experiences.
- [Hosted Payment Page](https://www.checkout.com/products/hosted-payment): Deploy a pre-built, low-code payment page integration.
- [Mobile SDK](https://www.checkout.com/products/mobile-sdk): Build native mobile checkout experiences for iOS and Android.
- [Payment Links](https://www.checkout.com/products/payment-links): Accept payments on any channel using shareable payment links.
- [Plugins](https://www.checkout.com/products/plugins): Integrate Checkout.com into existing ecommerce platforms via pre-built plugins.

### Move — Payins and Payouts

- [Acquiring](https://www.checkout.com/products/acquiring): Access local acquiring capabilities across global markets.
- [Payment Methods](https://www.checkout.com/payment-methods): Process cards, bank transfers, and alternative payment methods worldwide.
- [Issuing](https://www.checkout.com/products/issuing): Launch and manage your own card program.
- [Payouts](https://www.checkout.com/technology/payouts): Send payouts to bank accounts and cards globally.

### Protect — Fraud, Risk, and Compliance

- [Fraud Detection](https://www.checkout.com/products/fraud-detection): Build and manage a robust risk and fraud prevention strategy.
- [Authentication (3DS)](https://www.checkout.com/products/authentication-3ds): Simplify 3D Secure authentication and regulatory compliance.
- [Identity Verification](https://www.checkout.com/products/identity-verification): Verify customer identities using AI-powered video technology.
- [Disputes](https://www.checkout.com/products/disputes): Manage and protect against chargebacks and payment disputes.
- [Vault](https://www.checkout.com/products/vault): Securely store, tokenize, and enrich payment data.

### Boost — Payment Performance

- [Intelligent Acceptance](https://www.checkout.com/products/intelligent-acceptance): Increase revenue and approval rates using AI-driven optimization.
- [Network Tokens](https://www.checkout.com/products/network-tokens): Encrypt and secure card payments with network-level tokenization.
- [Real-Time Account Updater](https://www.checkout.com/products/real-time-account-updater): Keep recurring payments flowing by automatically updating expired card details.

### Manage — Money Movement Controls

- [Dashboard](https://www.checkout.com/products/dashboard): Monitor and manage payment performance from a unified dashboard.
- [Treasury & FX](https://www.checkout.com/products/treasury-fx): Manage multi-currency cash flow, balances, and foreign exchange.

